        },
        {
          "id": "elder",
          "name": "村長莫倫",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 6,
          "pages": [
            {
              "graphic": {
                "assetId": "char_wizard"
              },
              "trigger": "action",
              "priority": "same",
              "commands": [
                {
                  "code": "text",
                  "text": "孩子，燈塔的燈芯燒盡了。沒有光，霧會吞掉整個村子。",
                  "actorId": "elder"
                },
                {
                  "code": "text",
                  "text": "森林裡的古樹下，藏著另一顆星光燈芯。守林人卡爾知道在哪裡。",
                  "actorId": "elder"
                },
                {
                  "code": "choices",
                  "options": [
                    {
                      "text": "我這就去森林。",
                      "commands": [
                        {
                          "code": "text",
                          "text": "走東邊的大路就到了。路上小心霧。",
                          "actorId": "elder"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "為什麼燈芯會在森林裡？",
                      "commands": [
                        {
                          "code": "text",
                          "text": "……那是很久以前的事了。先把燈芯帶回來吧，孩子。",
                          "actorId": "elder"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "code": "switch",
                  "ids": [
                    "talked_elder"
                  ],
                  "value": true
                },
                {
                  "code": "quest",
                  "questId": "q_main",
                  "action": "start"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "switches": [
                  "talked_elder"
                ]
              },
              "graphic": {
                "assetId": "char_wizard"
              },
              "trigger": "action",
              "priority": "same",
              "commands": [
                {
                  "code": "text",
                  "text": "卡爾住在森林入口附近。東邊的大路走到底就是了。",
                  "actorId": "elder"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "itemId": "wick"
              },
              "graphic": {
                "assetId": "char_wizard"
              },
              "trigger": "action",
              "priority": "same",
              "commands": [
                {
                  "code": "text",
                  "text": "這光……是星光燈芯！你真的帶回來了。",
                  "actorId": "elder"
                },
                {
                  "code": "text",
                  "text": "卡爾一定跟你說了吧。燈芯是我父親從古樹裡取走的。森林從那年起就不再原諒我們。",
                  "actorId": "elder"
                },
                {
                  "code": "text",
                  "text": "孩子，我沒有資格替你決定。燈芯要點亮燈塔，還是還給森林？",
                  "actorId": "elder"
                },
                {
                  "code": "choices",
                  "options": [
                    {
                      "text": "點亮燈塔。村子需要光。",
                      "commands": [
                        {
                          "code": "text",
                          "text": "……謝謝你。我們會記得森林付出了什麼。",
                          "actorId": "elder"
                        },
                        {
                          "code": "item",
                          "itemId": "wick",
                          "delta": -1
                        },
                        {
                          "code": "quest",
                          "questId": "q_main",
                          "action": "complete"
                        },
                        {
                          "code": "ending",
                          "endingId": "end_light"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "還給森林。這是當年欠下的。",
                      "commands": [
                        {
                          "code": "text",
                          "text": "……我父親若在，也會這麼說吧。去吧，把它放回古樹。",
                          "actorId": "elder"
                        },
                        {
                          "code": "switch",
                          "ids": [
                            "return_wick"
                          ],
                          "value": true
                        },
                        {
                          "code": "quest",
                          "questId": "q_main",
                          "action": "step",
                          "step": 3
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "讓我再想想。",
                      "commands": [
                        {
                          "code": "text",
                          "text": "不急。霧還要好幾夜才會到。",
                          "actorId": "elder"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "switches": [
                  "return_wick"
                ]
              },
              "graphic": {
                "assetId": "char_wizard"
              },
              "trigger": "action",
              "priority": "same",
              "commands": [
                {
                  "code": "text",
                  "text": "森林在等你，孩子。",
                  "actorId": "elder"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
