                  "code": "text",
                  "text": "燈塔熄了以後，晚上好黑……我都不敢睡。",
                  "actorId": "hoa"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "switches": [
                  "wick_taken"
                ]
              },
              "graphic": {
                "assetId": "char_youth"
              },
              "trigger": "action",
              "priority": "same",
              "commands": [
                {
                  "code": "text",
                  "text": "哇，那是燈芯嗎？好亮喔！",
                  "actorId": "hoa"
                },
                {
                  "code": "if",
                  "condition": {
                    "type": "switch",
                    "id": "comforted_hoa",
                    "value": false
                  },
                  "then": [
                    {
                      "code": "text",
                      "text": "可是……如果燈塔又熄了怎麼辦？",
                      "actorId": "hoa"
                    },
                    {
                      "code": "choices",
                      "options": [
                        {
                          "text": "就算沒有燈塔，我也會陪著你。",
                          "commands": [
                            {
                              "code": "text",
                              "text": "……真的嗎？那我不怕了！",
